Modified portions
-----------------

The following files contain code adapted from SillyTavern
(https://github.com/SillyTavern/SillyTavern), which is licensed under
AGPL-3.0. They were modified for Comonad on 2026-10-18:

- packages/comonad-plugin-tavern/src/lib/regex.ts
  Adapted from public/scripts/extensions/regex/engine.js and
  public/scripts/utils.js.
- packages/comonad-plugin-tavern/src/lib/personas.ts
  Persona macro swapping adapted from public/scripts/personas.js.
- packages/comonad-plugin-tavern/src/lib/search.ts
  World-info search options and weights adapted from
  public/scripts/power-user.js.
- packages/comonad-plugin-tavern/src/lib/tags.ts
  Tag data model constants adapted from public/scripts/tags.js.

SillyTavern itself is not bundled, and its default content is not copied.

The kernel (graph runtime, capability model, approval policies and checkpoint
design) is carried over from the author's earlier Comonad project.

Third-party components and their licenses are listed in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
